```toml
[all.vars]
has_java = false

[web]
children = ["apache", "nginx"]
vars = { http_port = 8080, myvar = 23 }

[web.hosts]
host1 = {}
host2 = { ansible_port = 222 }

[apache.hosts]
tomcat2 = { myvar = 34 }
tomcat3 = { mysecret = "03#pa33w0rd" }

[nginx.vars]
has_java = true

[ungrouped.hosts]
host2 = { ansible_host = "127.0.0.1", ansible_port = 44 }
```

Hosts can also be written as tables, e.g. `[web.hosts.host2]` followed by `ansible_port = 222`.
